msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze007_03441:TEXT_LUCKZE007_03441_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Quest Sync</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Maril looks as though he is expecting someone."
msgstr "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Синхронизация заданий</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Похоже, Мариль кого-то ждёт."

#. ja: チャットの「Say」モードで『のばら』と入力し<br>熟練の衛士に挨拶する
#. de: Den Veteran der Wache im „Sagen“-Chatmodus<br>mit der Parole „Wildrose“ begrüßen
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, dire “Orchidée” au soldat vétéran
#. kind: objective
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
